{"componentChunkName":"component---src-layouts-blog-post-layout-js","path":"/blog/add-color-swatches-to-the-product-page-no-apps","result":{"pageContext":{"id":3804,"date":"2024-03-18T13:09:27","date_gmt":"2024-03-18T13:09:27","guid":{"rendered":"https://www.ezfy.club/?p=3804"},"modified":"2024-08-15T06:18:14","modified_gmt":"2024-08-15T06:18:14","slug":"add-color-swatches-to-the-product-page-no-apps","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https://www.ezfy.club/add-color-swatches-to-the-product-page-no-apps/","title":{"rendered":"Add color swatches to the product page [NO apps]"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Ever wished your Shopify free theme could have these beautiful, instant-loading color swatches? While there are apps that achieve this functionality, not only do they come with monthly fees, but they also take a toll on your website&#8217;s speed by injecting bloated code, thus prejudicing its performance and causing longer loading times.<br><br>With our copy/paste code, you&#8217;ll be able to replace all of your variant pills with actual colors without relying on any third parties. This will ensure your website can make good use of improved UX, with code being loaded as fast as technically possible.<br><br><a href=\"https://pandashopdeals.myshopify.com/products/colorful-bean-bag\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Here is a live demo of the end result</a>. <br><br>This live demo also uses our <a href=\"https://ezfycode.com/shop/dawn-theme-slider-pro\">Slider Pro with Vertical Thumbnail</a>, an improved Slider copy/paste code compatible with all Shopify&#8217;s free themes. <br><br>Without further ado, let&#8217;s dive in.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"NoticeBox NoticeBox--info\"><p>This tutorial is compatible only with Shopify&#8217;s official free themes: <b>Dawn, Refresh, Colorblock, Taste, Ride, Studio, Crave, Origin, Spotlight, Publisher, Sense &amp; Craft.</b></p></div>\n\n\n\n<p>Before diving into the tutorial make sure you download the theme, so in case you face any issues you can easily revert back.<br><br><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1514\" height=\"481\" class=\"wp-image-503\" style=\"width: 600px;\" src=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/dl-123.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/dl-123.png 1514w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/dl-123-600x191.png 600w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/dl-123-1200x381.png 1200w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/dl-123-768x244.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1514px) 100vw, 1514px\" /></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-creating-the-section-code\">Creating the section code</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol>\n<li>From your Shopify admin, go to&nbsp;<strong>Online Store</strong>&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;<strong>Themes</strong></li>\n\n\n\n<li>Find the theme you want to edit, click on the <strong>3 dots </strong>&gt;&nbsp;<strong>Edit Code</strong>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Find the sections folder and click on &#8220;Add a new section&#8221;. Name it exactly:<br><br><strong>ezfy-color-variants</strong><br><br><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1476\" height=\"849\" class=\"wp-image-3810\" style=\"width: 600px;\" src=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/t2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/t2.jpg 1476w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/t2-850x489.jpg 850w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/t2-1200x690.jpg 1200w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/t2-768x442.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1476px) 100vw, 1476px\" /></li>\n\n\n\n<li>Paste the following code inside and save:<br><br>[gist]5d35a5b9416f642a600b66f4854cae3e[gist]</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-adding-the-section-to-the-customize-page\">Adding the section to the Customize page</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol>\n<li>Find the file named <strong>theme.liquid</strong><br><br><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"637\" height=\"486\" class=\"wp-image-1300\" style=\"width: 600px;\" src=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/theme-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"><br></li>\n\n\n\n<li>Press CTRL + F (CMD + F on Mac) to trigger the search box and find:<br><br><strong>&lt;body</strong><br></li>\n\n\n\n<li>Paste the following code <strong>below</strong> the line you found:<br><br><strong>{% if template == &#8216;product&#8217; %} {% section &#8216;ezfy-color-variants&#8217; %} {% endif %}</strong><br><br><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1331\" height=\"841\" class=\"wp-image-3918\" style=\"width: 600px;\" src=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s4.jpg 1331w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s4-850x537.jpg 850w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s4-1200x758.jpg 1200w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s4-768x485.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1331px) 100vw, 1331px\" /><br></li>\n\n\n\n<li>Save the file.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-adding-colors-in-the-customize-page\">Adding colors in the customize page</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol>\n<li>Click on &#8220;3 dots &gt; customize theme&#8221;, on the top left.<br><br><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1382\" height=\"759\" class=\"wp-image-3829\" style=\"width: 600px;\" src=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/z4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/z4.jpg 1382w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/z4-850x467.jpg 850w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/z4-1200x659.jpg 1200w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/z4-768x422.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1382px) 100vw, 1382px\" /></li>\n\n\n\n<li>At the top, click on &#8220;Products &gt; default products&#8221;.<br><br><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1345\" height=\"864\" class=\"wp-image-3831\" style=\"width: 600px;\" src=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/z5.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/z5.jpg 1345w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/z5-850x546.jpg 850w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/z5-1200x771.jpg 1200w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/z5-768x493.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1345px) 100vw, 1345px\" /><br><br><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1307\" height=\"839\" class=\"wp-image-3833\" style=\"width: 600px;\" src=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/z6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/z6.jpg 1307w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/z6-850x546.jpg 850w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/z6-1200x770.jpg 1200w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/z6-768x493.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1307px) 100vw, 1307px\" /></li>\n\n\n\n<li>You should see a new section named <strong>EZFY Variant Colors</strong> above the header.<br><br><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1545\" height=\"901\" class=\"wp-image-3923\" style=\"width: 600px;\" src=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s5.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s5.jpg 1545w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s5-850x496.jpg 850w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s5-1200x700.jpg 1200w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s5-768x448.jpg 768w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s5-1536x896.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1545px) 100vw, 1545px\" /></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-how-to-customize-the-colors\">How to customize the colors</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol>\n<li>Click on the arrow to the left of <strong>EZFY Variant Colors</strong> > add block > color.<br><br>Before proceeding, as you can see, you can choose what type of block you&#8217;d like to add:<br><br>&#8211; color: a HEX color<br>&#8211; image: an image will show up instead of a HEX color. Use this sparingly. The image should be 50 x 50.<br>&#8211; multicolor: two HEX colors that will show up 50%/50% (multicolor)<br><br>In this example, let&#8217;s add a simple HEX color to the &#8220;Milky&#8221; variant.<br><br><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1316\" height=\"893\" class=\"wp-image-3926\" style=\"width: 600px;\" src=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s6.jpg 1316w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s6-850x577.jpg 850w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s6-1200x814.jpg 1200w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s6-768x521.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1316px) 100vw, 1316px\" /><br></li>\n\n\n\n<li>After you&#8217;ve clicked on &#8220;Color&#8221;, click on the new &#8220;Color&#8221; block that shows up.<br><br><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1212\" height=\"873\" class=\"wp-image-3928\" style=\"width: 600px;\" src=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s7.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s7.jpg 1212w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s7-850x612.jpg 850w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s7-1200x864.jpg 1200w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s7-768x553.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1212px) 100vw, 1212px\" /><br></li>\n\n\n\n<li>Add the variant name and its HEX color. Be mindful of uppercase character.<br><br><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1279\" height=\"849\" class=\"wp-image-3930\" style=\"width: 600px;\" src=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s8.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s8.jpg 1279w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s8-850x564.jpg 850w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s8-1200x797.jpg 1200w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s8-768x510.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1279px) 100vw, 1279px\" /><br></li>\n\n\n\n<li>The changes will not show up immediately &#8211; make sure you click on the &#8220;save&#8221; button to refresh the page.<br><br><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1478\" height=\"876\" class=\"wp-image-3934\" style=\"width: 600px;\" src=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s9.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s9.jpg 1478w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s9-850x504.jpg 850w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s9-1200x711.jpg 1200w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s9-768x455.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1478px) 100vw, 1478px\" /><br><br><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1419\" height=\"863\" class=\"wp-image-3932\" style=\"width: 600px;\" src=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s10.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s10.jpg 1419w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s10-850x517.jpg 850w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s10-1200x730.jpg 1200w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s10-768x467.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1419px) 100vw, 1419px\" /><br></li>\n\n\n\n<li>That is it! Now <strong>all products </strong>that have a variant named &#8220;Milky&#8221;, not only Naomi Bag, will show this color swatch instead.<br><br>You can deactivate the color swatch at any point by clicking on <strong>EZFY Variant Colors > enable</strong><br><br><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"819\" height=\"738\" class=\"wp-image-3936\" style=\"width: 600px;\" src=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s11.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s11.jpg 819w, https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/s11-768x692.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px\" /></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"you-may-also-like\">You may also like</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Here are some other tutorials you may be interested in. They work with &#8220;Dawn&#8221; plus all Shopify&#8217;s free themes (Craft, Refresh, Colorblock, Taste, Ride, Studio, Crave, Origin, Spotlight, Publisher &amp; Sense):<br><a href=\"https://ezfycode.com/blog/dawn-theme-product-page-slideshow-with-arrows-tutorial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">&#8211; Arrows &amp; vertical thumbnails for Dawn&#8217;s product pages<span><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://media3.giphy.com/media/w4LaQF8cp1akInO4Cp/giphy.gif\"></span></a><br><a href=\"https://ezfycode.com/blog/dawn-theme-how-to-fix-zoom-images-size-mobile-desktop?source=blog-dawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">&#8211; Dawn lightbox: responsive images, slider and arrows <span><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://media4.giphy.com/media/aBmvXTlfvHiPMXtx4a/giphy.gif\"></span></a><br><a href=\"https://ezfycode.com/blog/how-to-disable-right-click-image-and-text-copying-without-apps?source=blog-dawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">&#8211; Improve your website&#8217;s safety: block right click, image copying and more</a></p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Replace your products&#8217; color names with actual colors. Free and simple, no apps.</p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":3848,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[9],"tags":[655,626,657,435,776,773,663,649,652,646,660],"image_alt":"","featured_image_src":"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/dawn-badges-5-850x478.png","featured_image_small_src":"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/dawn-badges-5-200x200.png","featured_image_large_src":"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/dawn-badges-5-1200x675.png","categories_names":["Blog"],"acf":[],"tag_names":["Colorblock Theme","Craft Theme","Crave Theme","Dawn Theme","origin theme","publisher theme","Refresh theme","Ride theme","Sense Theme","Studio Theme","Taste theme"],"featured_image_url":"https://www.ezfy.club/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/dawn-badges-5.png","featured_image_url_alt":"","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https://www.ezfy.club/json/wp/v2/posts/3804"}],"collection":[{"href":"https://www.ezfy.club/json/wp/v2/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https://www.ezfy.club/json/wp/v2/types/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https://www.ezfy.club/json/wp/v2/users/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https://www.ezfy.club/json/wp/v2/comments?post=3804"}],"version-history":[{"count":9,"href":"https://www.ezfy.club/json/wp/v2/posts/3804/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":3938,"href":"https://www.ezfy.club/json/wp/v2/posts/3804/revisions/3938"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https://www.ezfy.club/json/wp/v2/media/3848"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https://www.ezfy.club/json/wp/v2/media?parent=3804"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https://www.ezfy.club/json/wp/v2/categories?post=3804"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https://www.ezfy.club/json/wp/v2/tags?post=3804"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https://api.w.org/{rel}","templated":true}]}}},"staticQueryHashes":["330429198","3356652627"]}